<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's LG-Caltex Oil resumes CDU operation.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's LG-Caltex Oil resumes CDU operation.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's LG-Caltex Oil Corp said its No 1 crude distillation unit (CDU) resumed operations on Thursday after an annual maintenance shutdown.</p>
<p>The 100,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) unit was closed down on June 3.</p>
<p>LG-Caltex, the nation's second-biggest refiner, has a refining capacity of 600,000 bpd.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
